NODE id=matrix/cortex/memory.CountTokens kind=func
  digest=b3:1241e418861252dfffa7c94a821fdd39d4fd7f92dcd0b4f6e34b7e8f4f9910fc file=cortex/memory/validate.go range=108:119 lang=go exported=true byte_range=3115:3552
  sig=func CountTokens(s string) int
  doc=CountTokens returns ceil(utf8_bytes(s) / BytesPerToken). Empty string → 0.\n\nDeterministic and zero-dependency. Public so the forms package and any\nbudget-enforcing caller (Find render, Compact) agree byte-for-byte with\nwrite-time validation. Switching the heuristic is a snapshot-hash-affecting\nchange.
