  ^calls=matrix/cortex.Cortex.Activate,matrix/cortex.Cortex.Compact,matrix/cortex.Cortex.Context,matrix/cortex.descentState.leaf,matrix/cortex/forms.TruncateToTokens,matrix/cortex/memory.validateForms,matrix/cortex/query.renderResults
