NODE id=matrix/cortex/memory.HashVector kind=func
  digest=b3:a73db0def5337a438802fdd9288fcebbcb9b3f24cb1e18565926e6af2d7d191e file=cortex/memory/codec.go range=143:164 lang=go exported=true byte_range=4112:4874
  sig=func HashVector(v []float32) [32]byte
  doc=HashVector returns sha256(VectorHashDomain || big-endian float32\ncomponents). Independent of CBOR map ordering so the hash is stable\nacross encoder versions. Carried in EmbedPayload.VectorHash and\nVectorMeta.VectorHash for replay-time integrity checking (Phase 11).
EDGES
