NODE id=matrix/cortex/memory.HashVersion kind=func
  digest=b3:29d670a0b54e69bcfbf9ef50b082db1803b8542234f6e712b9955a755c6037ac file=cortex/memory/codec.go range=166:193 lang=go exported=true byte_range=4876:5716
  sig=func HashVersion(v *Version) ([32]byte, error)
  doc=HashVersion computes the version's content hash. The hash inputs are:\n  - HashDomain string\n  - the Type byte\n  - the canonical CBOR of a "hashable view" of the Version: every field\n    EXCEPT Hash itself (otherwise we'd need to hash a struct that contains\n    its own hash — chicken-and-egg).\n\nWe achieve "every field except Hash" by zeroing Hash before encode and\nrestoring it after.
EDGES
